                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a663359b-64ee-3e95-a875-f05a056c366e",
                        "entry_id": "91ebf81f-ef44-3887-868d-d500545f45d7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A feeling (other than taste) perceived inside the mouth.",
                            "The texture of food, drink, etc. as perceived by the mouth."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9427c14e-ff73-471b-ac43-307ac3119aab",
                                "sense_id": "a663359b-64ee-3e95-a875-f05a056c366e",
                                "text": "Dark ale tends to have a creamy mouthfeel."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3b394b31-65d5-41fd-9d4c-56a78645b623",
                                "sense_id": "a663359b-64ee-3e95-a875-f05a056c366e",
                                "text": "Liquid foods which are essentially Newtonian fluids may be considered to have their texture or “mouthfeel” adequately described by their viscosity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d33deef-c252-4f16-8d3d-533567a205f3",
                                "sense_id": "a663359b-64ee-3e95-a875-f05a056c366e",
                                "text": "“Unctuous is probably quite a good description, but there's a sweetness, too, and a mouthfeel,” ventures Heston Blumenthal, chef at the Fat Duck at Bray."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3aa30df3-e86d-41c8-b71a-1b0db1ee8f5c",
                                "sense_id": "a663359b-64ee-3e95-a875-f05a056c366e",
                                "text": "The disappearance of hummus from the shelves after a hygiene problem at a plant supplying supermarkets has revealed the depth of popular addiction to this appealing paste. Its taste, at once earthy and refreshing, now has a large place in the British palate. Its grainy texture offers what food chemists call “mouthfeel” at its best."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0436216-0acd-4bf8-93ab-76ebd6495928",
                                "sense_id": "a663359b-64ee-3e95-a875-f05a056c366e",
                                "text": "“So to start with,” Adria says, “it [a transgender woman's penis] doesn’t get as hard, it doesn’t really ejaculate, and it has a different mouthfeel. Can we please talk about the mouthfeel? Why is no one talking about the mouthfeel?” she repeats, looking straight into the camera through her clear-framed glasses as the camera zooms in."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "385a9b56-da75-49a6-9f5c-7e3d7c33ec8c",
                                "sense_id": "a663359b-64ee-3e95-a875-f05a056c366e",
                                "text": "Our five tasters[…]conducted a blind test of the biscuits. They were asked to assess them on their appearance (an even golden-brown); aroma (biscuity); mouthfeel (either pleasantly chewy or with a satisfying crunch); and flavour (balanced, perfumed with golden syrup and earthy with oats)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "329279e0-1e05-3dd2-aa03-9bae8737d874",
                        "entry_id": "91ebf81f-ef44-3887-868d-d500545f45d7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A feeling (other than taste) perceived inside the mouth.",
                            "The sensations of the tongue when it moves around in the mouth."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "82f428d4-036d-4f25-96df-3ba7101b0874",
                                "sense_id": "329279e0-1e05-3dd2-aa03-9bae8737d874",
                                "text": "I have a much better mouthfeel since my broken tooth has been repaired."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
